ethernet.ipv6.sctp.f1ap
    ethernet.ipv6.sctp.f1ap.F1AP-PDU.initiatingMessage.value.DLRRCMessageTransfer.protocolIEs.Item 3.ProtocolIE-Field.value.RRCContainer.9   ).NR Radio Resource Control (RRC) protocol.DL-DCCH-Message.message.c1.rrcReconfiguration.criticalExtensions.rrcReconfiguration.measConfig.reportConfigToAddModList.Item 1.ReportConfigToAddMod.reportConfig.reportConfigNR.reportType.eventTriggered.eventId = 2
