    ethernet.ipv6.sctp.f1ap.F1AP-PDU.initiatingMessage.value.DLRRCMessageTransfer.protocolIEs.Item 3.ProtocolIE-Field.value.RRCContainer.10  ).NR Radio Resource Control (RRC) protocol.DL-DCCH-Message.message.c1.rrcReconfiguration.criticalExtensions.rrcReconfiguration.nonCriticalExtension.masterCellGroup.CellGroupConfig.spCellConfig.reconfigurationWithSync.spCellConfigCommon.physCellId = 51
